      "problem": "Let\n$r=[\\begin{aligned}x-2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ and $s=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ x \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$\nIf $r\\cdot s=7$, find the value of $x.$",
